-- CO2 injection into three 5 m layers of 30 cells, of 50, 100 and 200 mD,
-- with a vertical permeability of 10 mD. The injector is vertical with a
-- connection in every layer. The producer is deviated: it runs along x from
-- the top layer of column 28 to the bottom layer of column 30, with a
-- connection in each cell on its path, so its connections differ in depth
-- and in column. Both bottom-hole pressures refer to the centre of the top
-- layer. Initial water saturation is 0.5 (krw = 0.105). Both wells use
-- bottom-hole pressure control. The schedule spans 50 days in 36 report
-- steps.
------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUNSPEC
------------------------------------------------------------------------
TITLE
   SIMPLE CO2 INJECTION WITH MOBILE WATER AND A DEVIATED PRODUCER

METRIC

LICENSES
'sim_compositional' /
/

TABDIMS
/
OIL
GAS
WATER
DIMENS
30 1 3
/
HWELLS
COMPS
3 /

FULLIMP

-- damp the segmented wellbore densities as intended
OPTIONS3
212* 1 /

WELLDIMS
2 3 1* 2/

START
  1 'JAN' 2016  /

REGDIMS
1 1 0 0 /

UNIFIN
UNIFOUT

------------------------------------------------------------------------
GRID
------------------------------------------------------------------------
INCLUDE
 'include/GRID_LAYERS.inc' /


------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROPS
------------------------------------------------------------------------
INCLUDE
 'include/PROPS.inc' /


------------------------------------------------------------------------
SOLUTION
------------------------------------------------------------------------

PRESSURE
90*75.
/

SGAS
90*0.5
/

SWAT
90*0.5
/

TEMPI
90*150
/

ZMF
90*0.1
90*0.3
90*0.6
/

